IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `bgg4-nouns`

-- bgg4-new-submissions: BGG 4. Kapitel, 3. Abschnitt, Neue Vorbringen (Art. 99).
-- LAYER 1: the law, objectively; nobody's point of view.
-- Answers are MAYBE BOOLEAN: JUST TRUE (the text says yes), JUST FALSE (the text says no,
-- tagged FALSE-kind), NOTHING (not covered, tagged NOTHING-kind).  See bgg4-appealable for the key.
-- Art 99 has no heading of its own in the text (the heading line is only "Art. 99").

§ `Art 99 Neue Vorbringen (new submissions)`

-- src:57 | 1 Neue Tatsachen und Beweismittel dürfen nur so weit vorgebracht werden, als erst der Entscheid der Vorinstanz dazu Anlass gibt.
@ref Art. 99(1) BGG (src:57)
GIVEN `the submission is a new fact or new evidence` IS A BOOLEAN                         -- neue Tatsachen und Beweismittel
      `only the decision of the lower instance gave occasion for it` IS A BOOLEAN         -- erst der Entscheid der Vorinstanz dazu Anlass gibt
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 99(1) the new fact or new evidence may be put forward` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the submission is a new fact or new evidence` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the paragraph reaches only "Neue Tatsachen und Beweismittel"
        IF `only the decision of the lower instance gave occasion for it` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE     -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "dürfen nur so weit vorgebracht werden, als erst der Entscheid der Vorinstanz dazu Anlass gibt" (a list closed with "nur"; the text says "so weit", to the extent that: the person states the fact as a yes or no, fork F8)

-- src:58 | 2 Neue Begehren sind unzulässig.
@ref Art. 99(2) BGG (src:58)
GIVEN `the claim is new` IS A BOOLEAN                         -- neues Begehren
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 99(2) the new claim is admissible` MEANS
    IF `the claim is new`
    THEN JUST FALSE         -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Neue Begehren sind unzulässig."
    ELSE NOTHING            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the flat negative reaches only "Neue Begehren"; of a claim that is not new the paragraph says nothing
